#. event 00 (look)
msgctxt "bark 01B1:009F"
msgid "Earth Titan "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:023F"
msgid "What human is this who comes before me? "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:0289"
msgid "I have business before you, lord. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:02E2"
msgid "What business could a living one have that concerns Me? "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:032A"
msgid "Vividos is now the Necromancer. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:0397"
msgid "I am very well aware of that, living one. And now Lothian must be interred. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:03D9"
msgid "Lothian must be interred? "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:0442"
msgid "Yes, the scent of her rotting flesh shall perfume my garden of delight. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:047E"
msgid "Lord, I beg a boon. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:04DE"
msgid "Bold you are to beg a boon from me, mortal. What is this boon? "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:052C"
msgid "I wish to become Vividos' apprentice. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:05A3"
msgid "You wish to apprentice to the Necromancer? Then fall before me and serve your master! "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:070C"
msgid "Now, kneel before me, worm. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:0796"
msgid "To become the apprentice, you must inter Lothian into my clay. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:07D6"
msgid "How do I do this, lord? "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:0846"
msgid "Ask this of the Necromancer. He will teach you for it is his task to serve me. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:0881"
msgid "Farewell, my lord. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 01B1:090F"
msgid "You may now leave my presence, live one. Do not come before me again until you yourself are the Necromancer. "
msgstr ""
